# Tests for runtime layer

After changes here, run:

```bash
pytest tests/runtime -q
```

Coverage: `AtomPoint.resolve` (object+ID, residue fallback, `PointUnresolvedError`), `PyMOLRuntime` materialize/sync/remove/reconcile, session blob read/write without touching live `pymol.session`.

If production code calls a new `cmd.*` API, implement it on `tests/fakes/cmd.py` before writing the test.

Related unit tests: `tests/unit/test_points.py`, `tests/unit/test_serialize.py`.

Opt-in live PyMOL: `pytest -m pymol tests/pymol/test_session.py`
